Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angewomon,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ganzi relaxation.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.36,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.56,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't anything be simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as we finished working on\Na part of the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that our O 'Kennymon lady turned a control
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spire into another one\Nof her fake Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.42,0:01:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minotaurmon started to\Ndestroy all our hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis thought we should\Nask Ken to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.98,0:01:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought he was nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.40,0:01:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what else is new?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy called Ken and filled a\Nminute on what was happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.18,0:01:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, our O 'Kennymon created\Na really mean Digimon, Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of our Digimon had any effect on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Davis tried to convince Ken\Nthat they need to be friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.02,0:01:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this weird thing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.22,0:02:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Stingmon and X-B-Mon\Nsomehow digibomb together.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.68,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fscx120\fscy120\pos(315,333)}Invincible Fusion! Paildramon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Negi-gattach, Fire Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.14,0:02:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-B-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.18,0:02:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had a Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.82,0:02:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No monsters, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At Scream and Stingmon, DMA\NDigivolved into Paieldramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His Desperado Blaster attack\Nwill defeat Akuwamon for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.98,0:02:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your first shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.74,0:02:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They became one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he possibly win?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just lost me, Umi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready for round two?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.24,0:03:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick Factor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're grounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll find something fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's most certainly beating\Nthe tar out of that Agumon chap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but does he have\Nto make it look so easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes the rest of\Nus look like weaklings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tearing up Agumon like\Nhe was a scratching post.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.58,0:03:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't understand why he\Nhad to merge with Ken's Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.40,0:03:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our Digimon is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're working together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the power of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I like this\Nidea of a shared Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The right jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot to go knock him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mike, you're the class of kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about us.\NYeah, let's go. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have all day, slowpokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fleeing in terror, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.30,0:04:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, it's such a shame you'll\Nnever outrun a Kuwagamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry, cable catcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His feet are faster than his brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is, the entrance to the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Course looks clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they'll get\Nthrough all this rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I suppose Ken and Davis\Njust didn't hear you, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we just need to get the\NCrest of Kindness up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right below its symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, quit stalling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power is shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reactor's going offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't explode now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked! Nicely done! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They managed to return the warp to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's a message from Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warp's back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Score one for the good guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that work and we only get\None point? TK! You get two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to your crest. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:06:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, shutting down the\Nreactor isn't stopping the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plan didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hat's great in the rain, but\Nit doesn't work on concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy says the warp is getting worse,\Nnot better, but the crest didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did everything we were supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We put the Crest of Kindness\Nback where it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew something like this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My crest is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Crest of Kindness should\Nhave stopped the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be something else about\Nthis place that we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something you're\Nnot telling us, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if there was anyone\Nwho would know what it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that person would have to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is gonna collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman's behind all this trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real bad egg, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And soon you will all be scrambled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't scare us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll beat you yet. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even seem to\Nknow if you're fighting the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right enemy or if your friends\Nare really your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll never win eat\Ndrink and be merry little
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digi destined for soon\Nyou'll be crushed oh but
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's exactly what\Ni'll do she's trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,turn them against me wait\Nthe pipes why of course
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to follow these pipes.\NHey, where is he going? Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just one little explosion and those nosy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little brats will be\Nout of my hair forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, let's get rid\Nof Paildramon, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A-Cormon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mr. Night Guy! Sting strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These pipes send energy\Nto the reactor above.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Following them will lead us\Nright to the source of its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we plug that source,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.38,0:08:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should be able to stop the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reactor from
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exploding
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.57,0:08:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come out, wherever you are
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.68,0:08:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These tunnels give me the creeps You\Nknow, this reminds me of something
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much further do we have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tunnel's blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do? Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to old Armadillo now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Diamond shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feather strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:08:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we may continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Olly olly oxen free!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is, the source\Nof the reactor's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, if evil's got a color, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This feels just like when\Nwe were near that whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Potamot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the same disturbing feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was pulled into the world that\Nlooked like a negative photograph,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything that was supposed\Nto be light was dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.73,0:10:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a doorway that leads directly to\Nthe world of darkness. How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I've been surrounded by this energy\Never since I came to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about to explode! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to close the opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dark power is coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think we should do, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.90,0:10:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really know, but we've\Ngot to stop that power flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be something around\Nhere that we can use to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, that looks like big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to end this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call going to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's time to save some Digi-Dustin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what a doozy! Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, but my pride is bruised.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power output is increasing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks like the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't they run?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone call for a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I know how to make an entrance or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warp's returning to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my stiff neck is and I gotta\Nlearn not to get so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy says the warp is returning to\Nnormal, and it's all thanks to Paildramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save the accolades.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was just a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The war is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your little victory while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat, drink, and be merry to look\NDigidestined, for soon you'll be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Busters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, blow it up so no one\Nelse can ever use it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did we do things the way you wanted us to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did an excellent job, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, you're V-mon... aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, Davis, you could\Njust call me Chibimon for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.26,0:12:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever your name is, you rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We make a great team, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We make a good team, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't feel like I deserve to\Nbe friends with any of you. At all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, that's a lot of baloney.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.32,0:13:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Ken, you've earned our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have? Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure, you started out all mean and evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you decided to change\Nand become one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And working hard like that builds the\Nstrongest kind of friendship there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know friendship, and after\Nall we've been through, we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm absolutely not going\Nto take no for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done a lot of bad things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things I'm not proud of at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, all of us have made\Nmistakes. Look at Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She makes them all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.48,0:13:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need some time to think about this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Ken, no, don't go. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're friends now You\Nalways come on so strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis You can't force him\Nto be your friend if he's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not ready You have to let\Nit happen naturally Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we just fought together That\Nmakes us friends, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting's one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but maybe afterwards he\Nrealized he wasn't ready to be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friends Or maybe he's just\Nupset with a certain someone
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for pointing out how he makes\Nmistakes Let's not fight
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just keep an eye on\NKen and see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely nothing\Nany of us can do about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope he decides\Nto become our friend soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he doesn't start thinking it'd\Nbe easier to go back to being evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Izzy, we'll be there tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.18,0:14:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew, are Paphons supposed\Nto be this sticky?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did Izzy say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants us to meet him tomorrow so he\Ncan tell us all about DNA Digivolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wish he weren't so smart So\Nhe didn't have so much to tell us Davis
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it hurts my brain\Nto hold all that information
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we trust Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think If we're going to be friends, we\Nhave to learn to trust each other, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:14:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's just something\Nabout him that worries me Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:15:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,less speaking, more sleeping, Kay
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the sun has almost set
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talk to Izzy tomorrow And then we'll\Nfigure out what to do about Ken Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before that, we get to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're always hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll see you guys tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.53,0:15:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.45,0:15:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's wrong with Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd want to be friends with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll see how\Ngreat it is to be friends
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with you and how great it\Nis to DNA Digivolve with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was some fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if Ken never comes back again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was afraid that you'd\Ndisappear forever, Leafmon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you DNA-digivolved with Chibimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I liked it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made me feel like we were needed\Nagain, part of something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they really could be my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Ken, you're sleeping on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, it sure is early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and Davis is late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sense running.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.52,0:16:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're already late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.93,0:16:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're back to Demi Vimon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.98,0:16:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just needed a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you want to see\Nhim do his pop attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.70,0:16:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch where you point that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now come on, we're already late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it and how does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm now creating a computer\Nprogram that'll explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But until it's done, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When two Digimon DNA Digivolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the most powerful part\Nof one of them merges
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.20,0:16:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the most powerful part of the second,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,producing a Digimon that's more\Npowerful than either of them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you wanted to\Ntell us about DNA Digivolving?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, I wanted to show\Noff my new computer program,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's also something even\Nmore serious I have to relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us hanging, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:16:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd really hope to find a way to tell\Nyou using my new computer program.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're here now, so please\Ntell us the secret, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA digivolving has happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Omnimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Omnimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me explain exactly how\Nhe came into existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gennai called us back\Nto the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was great seeing our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought we'd never see them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just figured that when\Nwe destroyed Apocalymon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the warp was repaired\Nand that was the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Gennai told us that we also\Nhad to release the powers that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.64,0:17:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protect the digital world in order\Nto defeat the forces of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had a habit of telling long stories\Nthat I'm not sure even he understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we all listened intently\Nto what he had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when he was done, we\Nknew what we had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The powers that protect the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. Izzy told\Nme this story once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks those powers\Nare the same forces that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,originally picked us\Nto be the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.94,0:17:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To defeat the forces of darkness, we\Nhad to release the powers of our crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eight of us knew that this\Nwas the only way to save the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digital world from the evil\Nforces that were threatening it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our eight crests combined\Nto create a powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,force that spread across\Nthe digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of a coating of goodness,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like the lamination on a baseball card,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or the plastic that covers\Na new box of floppy disks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It brought peace and beauty\Nto the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The evil shield stopped the\Nforces of darkness from spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was great, except there was a side\Neffect none of us were prepared for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we had to give up\Nthe power of our crest,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.08,0:18:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our Digimon lost their ability to\NDigivolve to their ultimate forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a sacrifice that meant, in a way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they had to say goodbye to a\Nspecial part of themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all took it pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not sad anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we know we'll be able to\NDigivolve to Ultimate one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, we'll even use balls\Nof yarn to fight if we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's nothing that\Nwill slow you guys down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.52,0:19:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us all this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.20,0:19:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we're trying\Nto keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sometimes it's really hard to\Nadmit when you have a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a way, though, it's not\Nreally a weakness at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A DNA Digivolve Digimon kind of\Nfights a lot like an ultimate Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolving is very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sort of like when\NMetal Garurumon and Warb
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raymon Digivolve together\Nto become Omnimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw that happen on the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but I still haven't\Nfinished my story here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,XVmon and Stingmon DNA\NDigivolve into Paildramon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.98,0:19:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because of the threat Okuomon presented.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so can they only dna\Ndigivolve when there's a big
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough threat there's only\None way for us to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.80,0:19:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for sure we've got to go to\Nthe digital world and fight
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that evil white haired lady\Nbut she's so powerful i
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mean she turned a control\Nspire into an ultimate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digimon i wonder who she is\Nwhat she wants and how to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeat her hey what are we\Nall sitting around moping
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for if Gautoman's willing to\Nfight with a ball of yarn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing? Ready, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digitama, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, my mom will be home any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who wants snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, donuts, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mrs. Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very welcome. Wow, what\Nbig appetites you all have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.92,0:20:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd think that none of you had\Never seen food before Um, Izzy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to that\Nfriend of yours, Tento?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Tento Mon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, then
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, see, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to get away\Nfrom the end of the day.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.92,0:21:31.35,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The road that I see in the future\Nwill be taken away from the road.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.35,0:21:37.10,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to turn back on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to connect with each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.85,0:21:45.32,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.32,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.90,0:21:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to connect with each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.00,0:22:02.84,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.00,0:22:09.84,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.01,0:22:16.73,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.93,0:22:24.27,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.72,0:22:58.81,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx110\fscy110\c&HDFE1E0&\pos(316,326)}The Insect Charmer's Trap!!

